---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Diversity, Equity & Inclusion" description="Burnham Nationwide's commitment to diversity and inclusion: a respectful, inclusive culture that drives performance and innovation." nav="about">
  <div class="page-band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li>About</li><li>Diversity &amp; inclusion</li></ol>
      <nav aria-label="About Burnham"><a href="/about/why-burnham/">Why Burnham</a><a href="/about/team/">Team</a><a href="/about/history/">History</a><a href="/about/testimonials/">Testimonials</a><a href="/about/careers/">Careers</a><a href="/diversity-inclusion/" aria-current="page">Diversity</a><a href="/about/faq/">FAQ</a></nav>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap grid grid--2 grid--center">
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="eyebrow">Diversity &amp; inclusion</div>
        <h1 class="h-display">Inclusive culture. Conclusive results.</h1>
        <p class="lede">Burnham Nationwide believes diversity nurtures performance and innovation. It strengthens the communities where its people live and work and enriches each of their lives.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="media media--tall"><img src="/assets/img/about/diversity.jpg" alt="Rows of wooden figures painted in many different colors" width="1600" height="909"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--muted">
    <div class="wrap grid grid--2">
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="eyebrow">Our commitment</div>
        <h2 class="h-section">Recognizing, understanding and appreciating differences.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="stack">
        <p class="body">As the workforce evolves to reflect the growing diversity of the world, understanding, valuing and incorporating differences has never been more essential to Burnham’s success.</p>
        <p class="body">Burnham’s vision is to be a role model for diversity by fostering a culture of inclusion and respect where all people, of all ages, gender identities, races, sexual orientations, physical or mental abilities, ethnicities and perspectives, live, work and play in buildings that are safe, well built and welcoming.</p>
        <div class="callout">
          <div class="callout__title">A journey, not a destination</div>
          <div class="callout__body">Burnham is committed to continually gauging its progress, learning how to improve, and becoming a company that is diverse in perspective, experience and talent.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap cta-block">
      <div class="stack stack--sm">
        <h2>Grow with Burnham.</h2>
        <p>Burnham is always looking for talented people with diverse perspectives and experience to join its teams across the country.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/about/careers/">Explore careers</a>
        <a class="btn btn--on-dark" href="/about/why-burnham/">Our values</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
